id: cloaked
name: Cloaked
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Cloaking System's mark - the Invisible State is its third effect's, for its fifth.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Cloaking System: Invisible through it - 8(bT) Ki Points and Capacity as each of your turns begins.
text: >
  Cloaking System (5): If you are in the Invisible State due to the 3rd effect of Cloaking System, reduce your Ki Points and Capacity by 8(bT).

---

[passive]
